{"data":[{"author_id":"1779073986930053121","created_at":"2026-10-10T03:14:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108758123775508989"],"id":"2108758123775508989","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":51,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"三星开源 LittleBit-2：大模型压到 0.1 bit/权重，Llama2-13B 塞进 0.9GB\n三星研究院在官方博客详解了 ICML 2026 论文 LittleBit-2，并开源了代码（GitHub: SamsungLabs/LittleBit）。该技术把 LLM 压缩到 0.1~1.0 bit/权重：0.1 bit 下的 Llama2-7B 表现超过 0.7 bit 的竞品方法；Llama2-13B 可压到","url":"https://x.com/jameszz343698/status/2108758123775508989"},{"author_id":"2074799285334634497","created_at":"2026-10-09T23:23:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108699880764108867"],"id":"2108699880764108867","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":22,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"纽约大学数学教授 Tristan Buckmaster 称，OpenAI 集中发布的 722 篇 AI 生成数学论文直接清空了多个完整的研究课题，重创了早期职业数学家的学术生涯。当大模型能够成批量推演并生成专业论文，依赖漫长周期深耕细分课题的青年学者面临研究成果被瞬间覆盖的生存冲击。#OpenAI","url":"https://x.com/ayoosignal/status/2108699880764108867"},{"author_id":"2071871914533068800","created_at":"2026-10-09T13:49:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108555569959489732"],"id":"2108555569959489732","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":471,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"三星把130亿参数的大模型，压成了不到1GB\nLittleBit：每个权重平均 0.1 比特，S1哥的旧手机终于看到了跑大模型的希望。\n\nS1哥的电脑硬盘，常年处于”红条”状态。不是因为我存了什么好东西，是因为我下了一堆本地大模型，每一个都十几个 G，跑起来风扇像要起飞，跑完一个问题，我泡的面都坨了。\n\n所以 10 https://t.co/elBTTStmjJ","url":"https://x.com/swordBluesy/status/2108555569959489732"},{"author_id":"1692146406914760704","created_at":"2026-10-09T04:43:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108417952349671811"],"id":"2108417952349671811","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":235,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"用小 run 预测大模型训练配置，是把炼丹变实验科学的关键一步。坑在可迁移性：小模型最优超参不自动适用于大模型，lr/宽度的 scaling 规则不匹配就全推错，μP 这类迁移规则就是为补这个洞存在的。愿意花三个月把公开研究汇总成可操作指南，比转 arXiv 摘要有用多了。 https://t.co/7AnhFtfRhh","url":"https://x.com/KakaluoteW45042/status/2108417952349671811"},{"author_id":"2094110772213489664","created_at":"2026-10-10T09:24:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108851233188626618"],"id":"2108851233188626618","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"建筑行业也被AI卷到了 🏗️\n\n上海交大重庆研究院发布\"建筑交互大模型\"\n说白话就是：你用大白话问建筑数据，AI自动给你出报告\n以后画图狗是不是要改名叫\"AI建筑prompt工程师\"了？\n\n#AI落地 #建筑AI #大模型 #人工智能","url":"https://x.com/trupmtethan888/status/2108851233188626618"},{"author_id":"2108726254191218689","created_at":"2026-10-10T06:47:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108811742449156464"],"id":"2108811742449156464","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天看到很多品牌开始做 GEO（生成式引擎优化），研究怎么让大模型在回答时多提自己几句。\n\n以前是给搜索引擎的爬虫做优化，现在变成了研究怎么进大模型的语料库。\n\n大家找信息的方式变了，抢曝光的逻辑也跟着换了。","url":"https://x.com/Nexbzr/status/2108811742449156464"},{"author_id":"603441045","created_at":"2026-10-10T19:02:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108996534297924044"],"id":"2108996534297924044","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":260,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"《AI七链百股》007｜PLTR：Palantir\n\nAI时代最值得研究的应用公司之一：为什么它不研发最强大模型，却可能成为AI商业化的重要赢家？\n\n前六篇，我们研究了NVDA、MU、GEV、ANET、COHR和GOOGL。\n\n今天来到AI七大板块的最后一个板块：\n\n应｜AI应用\n\n研究Palantir Technologies（PLTR）。","url":"https://x.com/ForrestQin/status/2108996534297924044"},{"author_id":"1977757599031513088","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:06:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108861798636199988"],"id":"2108861798636199988","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"腾讯首席 AI 科学家姚顺雨在高层调研座谈会和马化腾邻座，引发全网热议。这位 98 年的前 OpenAI 研究员，2025 年底入职腾讯，全面掌管大模型与算力基建。高管同框释放明确信号：AI 业务在腾讯内部优先级持续拉高，接下来大模型研发投入会持续加码。 #腾讯 #AI #姚顺雨 #大模型","url":"https://x.com/web3raymond/status/2108861798636199988"},{"author_id":"273876266","created_at":"2026-10-10T08:15:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108833699886485927"],"id":"2108833699886485927","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":1242,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"比较关注的一个 “AI + 大模型 + 健康”  方向的一些前沿研究资料    \n\nhttps://t.co/Bg5adBNMpf \nhttps://t.co/BVMU27eE84 https://t.co/VKrjHU7q38 \nhttps://t.co/Bg5adBNMpf https://t.co/RTMWwHzlb1","url":"https://x.com/alacheng/status/2108833699886485927"},{"author_id":"1818255104790982656","created_at":"2026-10-10T20:30:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109018745477734413"],"id":"2109018745477734413","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"一个本来只想随便测测的 GEO 实验，彻底把 ChatGPT 的检索底裤给扒了。\n研究员 Metehan Yesilyurt 在 7 个月前花了几十美元，用 AI 捏造了 5 万条完全虚构的统计数据建了个假网站，想看看大模型吃不吃这套。\nGoogle 不到一个月就判定是垃圾站并清退去索引；但 ChatGPT 整整 7 个月都在持续引用它，过去 https://t.co/jBzKfG3o1i","url":"https://x.com/dsoch8c/status/2109018745477734413"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1779073986930053121","name":"GlowJames 追光🐬","username":"jameszz343698"},{"id":"2074799285334634497","name":"AyooSignal｜情报站","username":"ayoosignal"},{"id":"2071871914533068800","name":"剑的 AI 实验室","username":"swordBluesy"},{"id":"1692146406914760704","name":"琦玉老师","username":"KakaluoteW45042"},{"id":"2094110772213489664","name":"亦丞Ethan","username":"trupmtethan888"},{"id":"2108726254191218689","name":"Nex","username":"Nexbzr"},{"id":"603441045","name":"秦刚｜赢位交易 RGT","username":"ForrestQin"},{"id":"1977757599031513088","name":"路透经纬社","username":"web3raymond"},{"id":"273876266","name":"头雁","username":"alacheng"},{"id":"1818255104790982656","name":"Colby","username":"dsoch8c"}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2109018745477734413","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juziz5n5q1yrxv405jc7lb91n5jnul","oldest_id":"2108417952349671811","result_count":10}}